WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.247 --> 00:00:02.464
- We're here in McDonald's

00:00:02.464 --> 00:00:05.117
and we're ordering some Shamrock Shakes.

00:00:05.117 --> 00:00:06.601
- And it's St. Patty's day.

00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:09.268
(hip hop music)

00:00:13.465 --> 00:00:15.715
♫ Let's go

00:00:22.207 --> 00:00:23.290
- We got 'em.

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:25.831
- I've never had one.

00:00:25.831 --> 00:00:28.248
I've never even heard of one.

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:31.039
Mmm,

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:35.271
it tastes like a mint
chocolate chip ice cream shake.

00:00:35.271 --> 00:00:36.534
- It tastes like a Junior Mint.

00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:37.367
- Mmm,

00:00:38.301 --> 00:00:39.596
mmmm.

00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:41.725
- It's like the melty part of
mint chocolate chip ice cream,

00:00:41.725 --> 00:00:43.700
like the soupy part.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:48.487
That's the best thing I've
ever had in my goddamned life.

00:00:48.487 --> 00:00:49.492
- It's minty.

00:00:49.492 --> 00:00:51.699
I don't love drinking mint.

00:00:51.699 --> 00:00:54.782
I'd rather have just a vanilla shake.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.910
- It's not as bad as
I thought it would be.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:58.743
But,

00:01:02.972 --> 00:01:04.011
yeah I do like it.

00:01:04.011 --> 00:01:05.734
- It's like if you

00:01:05.734 --> 00:01:08.226
had those York Peppermints,

00:01:08.226 --> 00:01:10.460
shredded the chocolate off,

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.276
and then mixed it up.

00:01:12.276 --> 00:01:13.680
I think that's exactly what it tastes like

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:14.803
and I don't hate it.

00:01:14.803 --> 00:01:16.470
I love it, actually.

00:01:19.987 --> 00:01:20.886
- Not for me.

00:01:20.886 --> 00:01:22.969
- It's like drinking gum.

00:01:24.154 --> 00:01:25.128
- I am offended.

00:01:25.128 --> 00:01:27.416
I am personally offended by everyone here.

00:01:27.416 --> 00:01:30.083
(hip hop music)

